@startuml
title Time Attendance, Timesheet Approval & Monthly Payroll Disbursement Workflow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #f8fafc
skinparam ActivityFontColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityFontStyle bold

skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #1d4ed8
skinparam SwimlaneWidth 230
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontColor #1e3a8a
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontSize 14
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontStyle bold

skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5

|Employee|
start
:Perform Daily Web / Biometric Clock-in & Clock-out;
:Submit Overtime (OT) or Leave Requests (if applicable);

|Department Manager|
:Review & Approve Daily OT & Leave Requests;
:Monitor Daily Shift Attendance & Lateness Logs;

|Employee|
:Review Monthly Working Hours Summary;
:Submit Attendance Discrepancy Explanation (if missed punch);

|Department Manager|
:Inspect Team Monthly Timesheet Grid;
:Resolve Attendance Anomalies & Flagged Errors;
if (Timesheet Data Complete?) then (Verified)
  :Approve & Lock Monthly Team Timesheet;
else (Incomplete)
  :Return Timesheet to Employee for Revision;
  stop
endif

|Payroll Administrator|
:Import Locked Timesheet Data into Payroll Engine;
:Execute Automated Salary Computation Formula;
:Calculate Gross Pay, OT Multipliers & Deductions;
:Compute BHXH Insurance & Personal Income Tax (PIT);
:Generate Draft Payroll Master Summary Sheet;

|HR Manager|
:Audit Payroll Master Sheet & Total Cost Variance;
if (Payroll Calculations Correct?) then (Approved)
  :Sign off Monthly Payroll Disbursement;
else (Discrepancy)
  :Request Payroll Recalculation;
  stop
endif

|Payroll Administrator|
:Generate Encrypted Bank Transfer Batch File (Excel/CSV);
:Transmit Disbursement File to Direct Deposit Bank;
:Issue Password-Protected Digital Payslips to Employees;

|Employee|
:Receive Payslip Notification via Portal & Email;
:Verify Net Pay Disbursement in Bank Account;
stop
@enduml
